[15058.329164, "o", "\u001b[1;6H\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 61 +\u001b[38;5;231mThe import gives every page a new uid and remaps only the root page of a site            \u001b[2;6H\u001b[38;5;77m 62 +\u001b[38;5;231mit copies from `Initialisation/Site/`.                                                   \u001b[3;3H\u001b[39m\u001b[49m   \u001b[2m 63 \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[4;6H\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m 66 -\u001b[38;5;231m`Initialisation/Site/main/config.yaml` names one more: the 404 error handling            \r\n\u001b[39m\u001b[49m \u001b[C   \u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m 67 -\u001b[38;5;231mshows `t3://page?uid=33`, the \"Page not found\" page. On any other installation,          \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[K\u001b[6;3H   \u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m 68 -\u001b[38;5;231mpoint it at that page in Site Management > Sites > Error Handling.                       \u001b[7;6H\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 64 +\u001b[38;5;231m`Classes/Initialization/RemapSitePageUidsOnPackageInitialization.php` translates         \u001b[8;3H\u001b[39m\u001b[49m   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 65 +\u001b[38;5;231mthe other four with the uid map the import kept, in the setup that imported the          \u001b[9;6H\u001b[38;5;77m 66 +\u001b[38;5;231mdata. It changes the site `main` where its root page is one of the imported              \r\n\u001b[39m\u001b[49m \u001b[C   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 67 +\u001b[38;5;231mpages, whether the site came from `Initialisation/Site/main/` or was in                  \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[K\u001b[11;3H   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 68 +\u001b[38;5;231m`config/sites/main/` already. A uid the import did not bring stays as it is.             \u001b[12;6H\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[2m 69 \u001b[13;3H\u001b(B\u001b[m   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 70 +\u001b[38;5;231mElsewhere, set them in the site settings (Site Management > Settings) to the             \u001b[14;6H\u001b[38;5;77m 71 +\u001b[38;5;231m\"Service navigation\" folder, the \"Footer navigation\" folder and the \"Search\"             \r\n\u001b[39m\u001b[49m \u001b[C   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 72 +\u001b[38;5;231mpage, and the error handling (Site Management > Sites > Error Handling) to the           \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[K\u001b[16;3H   \u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 73 +\u001b[38;5;231m\"Page not found\" page.                                                                   \u001b[17;6H\u001b[38;5;77m 74 +\u001b[38;5;231m                                                                                         \u001b[18;3H\u001b[39m\u001b[49m   \u001b[2m 75 \u001b(B\u001b[m The news plugins\u001b[Cname\u001b[Ctheir\u001b[Cpages\u001b[C(the\u001b[Cnews\u001b[Cfolder,\u001b[Cthe\u001b[Clist\u001b[Cand\u001b[Cthe\u001b[Cdetail\u001b[19;6H\u001b[2m 76 \u001b[C\u001b(B\u001b[mpage)\u001b[Cin\u001b[CFlexForm\u001b[Cfields\u001b[Cthe\u001b[Cimport\u001b[Cremaps,\u001b[Cso\u001b[Cthey\u001b[Cneed\u001b[Cno\u001b[Csite\u001b[Csetting.\r\n \u001b[C   \u001b[2m 77 \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[28;3H"]
[15058.343772, "o", "\u001b[1;8H\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m2\u001b[1;11H\u001b[38;5;231mit copies from `Initialisation/Site/`.   \u001b[C      \u001b[C    \u001b[C   \u001b[C    \u001b[C    \u001b[C  \u001b[C \u001b[C    \u001b[2;6H\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[2m 63 \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[3;6H\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[48;5;52m 66 -\u001b[38;5;231m`Initialisation/Site/main/config.yaml` names one more: the 404 error handling            \u001b[4;8H\u001b[38;5;167m7\u001b[4;11H\u001b[38;5;231mshows `t3://page?uid=33`, the \"Page not found\" page. On any oth\u001b[4;76H inst\u001b[Cllation,\u001b[5;8H\u001b[38;5;167m8\u001b[5;11H\u001b[38;5;231mpoint\u001b[Ci\u001b[C at that page in Sit\u001b[5;41HManagement > Sites > Error Handling.             \u001b[6;6H\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 64 +\u001b[38;5;231m`Classes/Initialization/RemapSitePageUidsOnPackageInitialization.php` translates         \u001b[7;8H\u001b[38;5;77m5\u001b[7;11H\u001b[38;5;231mthe other four w\u001b[Cth the uid map the import kept, in the setup that impo\u001b[Cted th\u001b[C \u001b[8;8H\u001b[38;5;77m6\u001b[8;11H\u001b[38;5;231mdata. It changes \u001b[8;30He site `main` where its\u001b[Croo\u001b[C page is\u001b[Cone of the\u001b[8;87H   \u001b[9;8H\u001b[38;5;77m7\u001b[9;11H\u001b[38;5;231mp\u001b[Cges, whether the site came from `Init\u001b[Calisation/Site/main/` or was in    \u001b[10;8H\u001b[38;5;77m8\u001b[10;11H\u001b[38;5;231m`config/si\u001b[Ces/main/` alre\u001b[Cdy. A uid the impor\u001b[C did not br\u001b[10;70Hg stays as it\u001b[Cis.\u001b[11;6H\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[2m 69 \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[12;6H\u001b[38;5;77m\u001b[48;5;22m 70 +\u001b[38;5;231mElsewhere, set them in the site settings (Site Management > Settings) to the             \u001b[13;8H\u001b[38;5;77m1\u001b[13;11H\u001b[38;5;231m\"Service naviga\u001b[Cion\" fold\u001b[Cr, \u001b[Che \"Footer\u001b[Cnavigation\" folder\u001b[Cand the \"Searc\u001b[C\"\u001b[14;8H\u001b[38;5;77m2\u001b[14;11H\u001b[38;5;231mpage, and the err\u001b[Cr handling\u001b[C(Site Management > Sites > Er\u001b[Cor Handling) to the\u001b[15;8H\u001b[38;5;77m3\u001b[15;11H\u001b[38;5;231m\"Page\u001b[Cnot\u001b[Cfound\" page.      \u001b[C     \u001b[C          \u001b[C \u001b[C     \u001b[C \u001b[C     \u001b[C         \u001b[C  \u001b[C   \u001b[16;8H\u001b[38;5;77m4\u001b[16;11H\u001b[38;5;231m     \u001b[C   \u001b[C      \u001b[C     \u001b[17;6H\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[2m 75 \u001b(B\u001b[m The news plugins name their pages (the news folder, the list and the detail\u001b[K\u001b[18;8H\u001b[2m6\u001b[18;11H\u001b(B\u001b[mpage) in\u001b[CF\u001b[CexForm fi\u001b[Clds the import r\u001b[Cmaps,\u001b[Cs\u001b[C they\u001b[Cne\u001b[Cd no site\u001b[Csetting.\u001b[K\u001b[19;8H\u001b[2m7\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[19;11H\u001b[K\u001b[20;6H\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m●\u001b[C\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b(B\u001b[m(Build/Initialisation/seed-page-tree.php)\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[38;5;174m*\u001b[C\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;216mScurrying…\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;174m \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;246m(1m 49s · ↓\u001b[C10.3k tokens)\r\n  ⎿  Tip: Use /btw to ask a side que\u001b[Ction without interrupting Claude\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[28;3H"]
