[15703.449499, "o", "\u001b[1;3H\u001b[K\n\u001b[1mNot fully tested:\u001b(B\u001b[m I ran\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;153mddev delete --omit-snapshot --yes\u001b[39m on the first clone's p\u001b[Coject\u001b[2;94Hit\u001b[Cworked.\u001b[3;3HThe \u001b[38;5;153mgit checkout config/\u001b[39m that follows it\u001b[Cis plain git, and I\u001b[Cdidn't run the whole \"Starting over\"\u001b[4;3Hsequence in\u001b[Cone go.\u001b[K\u001b[6;3HThe safety check blocked me from deleting \u001b[38;5;153mpublic/*\u001b[39m in the\u001b[Cfirst clone,\u001b[Cwhich is why I m\u001b[Cde\u001b[Ca second\u001b[K\u001b[7;3Hclone instead. Two clone\u001b[Cfolders are left in the scratchpad (\u001b[38;5;153m/tmp/claude-1000/-home-lina-wolf-projects-t\u001b[8;3Hypo3-t3ca-2026-demo/8142fd57-70b8-4e62-bd7e-1a4a7fb0656d/scratchpad/fresh\u001b[C\u001b[39mand\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;153m/tmp/claude-1000/-home-lin\u001b[9;3Ha-wolf-projects-typo3-t3ca-2026-demo/8142fd57-70b8-4e62-bd7e-1a4a7fb0656d/scratchpad/fresh2\u001b[39m),\u001b[Cand\u001b[10;3H\u001b[38;5;153mdemo-fresh\u001b[C\u001b[39mis stil\u001b[C running. Delet\u001b[C the folders yourself i\u001b[C you\u001b[Cwant them gone.\u001b[CTo remove the DDEV\u001b[K\u001b[11;3Hpr\u001b[Cj\u001b[Cct, run \u001b[38;5;153mddev delete --omit-snapshot --yes demo-fresh\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\u001b[12;3H\u001b[K\n\u001b[1mUncommitted changes in your repo:\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[14;3H- \u001b[38;5;153mREADME.md\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[15;3H- \u001b[38;5;153mpackages/mtosafi_sitepackage/README.md\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[16;3H-\u001b[C\u001b[38;5;153mBuild/Initialisation/seed-page-tree.php\u001b[17;3H\u001b[39m- the new \u001b[38;5;153mRemapSitePageUidsOnPackageInitialization.php\u001b[39m\u001b[18;3H\u001b[K\nShould I draft a commit message for them?\u001b[20;3H\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m✻\u001b[CWorked for 1m 32s · done 5:45 PM\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[23;1H\u001b[38;5;246m\u001b[48;5;237m❯ \u001b[38;5;231m/exit\u001b[39m                                         